
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">
  <title>VIKIPOUNS ALL IN 1 | VALL1</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff;
      color: #111;
    }
    header {
      padding: 20px;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 4px solid #d4af37;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; }
    .logo span { color: #d4af37; }
    header p { color: #ddd; font-size: 13px; }
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 45px 20px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
    .gold { color: #b38b16; }
    .hero p { line-height: 1.6; }
    .departments {
      padding: 25px 16px;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .departments h2 { text-align: center; }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #e0c46b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #0000000d;
    }
    .card h3 { margin-top: 0; }
    .card p { color: #555; line-height: 1.5; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d4af37;
      color: #111;
      padding: 11px 17px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .ai {
      margin: 20px 16px;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      border-top: 4px solid #d4af37;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">VIKI<span>POUNS</span></div>
    <p>ALL IN 1 INTERNATIONAL PLATFORM</p>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to <span class="gold">VALL1</span></h1>
    <p>ONE PLATFORM. FOUR DEPARTMENTS.<br>INFINITE POSSIBILITIES.</p>
    <a href="#departments" class="button">Explore VALL1</a>
  </section>

  <section class="departments" id="departments">
    <h2>Our Four Departments</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>1. Viki Trust Line</h3>
      <p>Wallet, savings, buyer and seller protection, currency tools and shipment tracking.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#coming">Explore</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>2. Viki Safe Pay</h3>
      <p>Private payments, group collections and secure payment distribution.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#coming">Explore</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>3. Viki Japa Assistant</h3>
      <p>Flight information, travel savings, reminders and overseas job discovery.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#coming">Explore</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>4. Viki Trust Jobs</h3>
      <p>Discover jobs, freelance opportunities and a marketplace for buyers and sellers.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#coming">Explore</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ai" id="coming">
    <h2>Viki Smart AI</h2>
    <p>Your VALL1 assistant. Get help understanding our platform and its services.</p>
    <p><strong>Coming soon</strong></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>VIKIPOUNS ALL IN 1 — VALL1</p>
    <p>White. Gold. Black.</p>
    <p>© 2026 VALL1. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
